Pagila sample database
======================

`pagila-schema.sql` and `pagila-data.sql` in this directory are the Pagila
sample database, vendored verbatim so the CI bench (EVAL.md section 5) loads
the same bytes the measured baselines were taken against. Both files were
verified byte for byte against upstream `master` on 2026-09-05:

    pagila-schema.sql  sha1 c6a11964a053e93fc8f988fa4d43e9ca071f4651
    pagila-data.sql    sha1 905cb5a5cef1aa6613536d1ea03741b3c8de05db

Upstream: https://github.com/devrimgunduz/pagila
Pagila is a port of the Sakila example database for MySQL, originally
developed by Mike Hillyer of the MySQL AB documentation team.

